A first beta of SuSE Linux 7.1 for IA64 is now available for download.
The ISO image can be found at the following place:

ftp://ftp.suse.com/pub/suse/ia64/beta-7.1

This release contains glibc 2.2, the 20001117 snapshot of the compiler
toolchain and kernel 2.4.0.

Please use our suse-ia64 mailing list for questions related to SuSE Linux
IA64.  For instructions on how to subscribe, please visit:

http://www.suse.com/us/support/mailinglists/index.html

